  "description_short": "Elegant boutique hotel restaurant in Heatherlands serving sophisticated meals in a refined Garden Route setting.",
  "description_long": "Nestled in the leafy suburb of Heatherlands, The Hawthorn Boutique Hotel offers a dining experience that balances elegance with the warmth of Garden Route hospitality. The restaurant, housed within this charming property, serves guests in a sophisticated yet welcoming atmosphere that's perfect for special occasions or leisurely meals.\n\nThe menu showcases carefully prepared dishes with attention to presentation and flavour, complemented by a well-curated wine selection. Whether you're enjoying breakfast before exploring George, a business lunch, or an intimate dinner, the service is attentive without being overbearing. The setting strikes that sweet spot between formal and comfortable, making it suitable for celebrations or simply treating yourself to a quality meal.\n\nWith its convenient George location and multiple event spaces, The Hawthorn functions as more than just a restaurant—it's a full hospitality venue. The lounge bar provides a relaxed spot for pre-dinner drinks or casual catch-ups, while the restaurant maintains its refined character throughout the day.",
